Code generation, run by hand and committed: generate-client.sh and
update-schema.sh for the django-api client, and generate-hook-types.sh, which
is just a lil' hack that takes the hook request/response types from the tusd
source, generates a JSON Schema from them, and turns that into a Pydantic file.

The operator tools that put videos on the ingest queue used to live here too.
They are `fk archive` in fk-cli now: they needed an API token and nothing this
repository has, and an operator has that binary already.
